ide-p2-s3","ord":2,"text":"Jun nodded slowly, remembering his first nervous day.","translation_ko":"준은 처음 두근거렸던 첫날을 떠올리며 천천히 고개를 끄덕였어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-209-the-welcome-guide/audio/p2-s3.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Jun","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":400},{"word":"nodded","charStart":4,"charEnd":10,"startMs":400,"endMs":840},{"word":"slowly","charStart":11,"charEnd":17,"startMs":840,"endMs":1260},{"word":"remembering","charStart":19,"charEnd":30,"startMs":2000,"endMs":2000},{"word":"his","charStart":31,"charEnd":34,"startMs":2000,"endMs":2260},{"word":"first","charStart":35,"charEnd":40,"startMs":2260,"endMs":2620},{"word":"nervous","charStart":41,"charEnd":48,"startMs":2620,"endMs":2880},{"word":"day","charStart":49,"charEnd":52,"startMs":2880,"endMs":3240}]}]},{"id":"daily-209-the-welcome-guide-p3","pageNo":3,"spread":"p3","imageUrl":"/seed/daily-209-the-welcome-guide/p3.webp","sentences":[{"id":"daily-209-the-welcome-guide-p3-s1","ord":0,"text":"Mina raised her hand. \"We should include a map of the school,\" she suggested.","translation_ko":"미나가 손을 들었어요. \"학교 지도를 넣어야 해요.\" 미나가 제안했어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-209-the-welcome-guide/audio/p3-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Mina","charStart":0,"charEnd":4,"startMs":0,"endMs":460},{"word":"raised","charStart":5,"charEnd":11,"startMs":460,"endMs":960},{"word":"her","charStart":12,"charEnd":15,"startMs":960,"endMs":1200},{"word":"hand","charStart":16,"charEnd":20,"startMs":1200,"endMs":1540},{"word":"We","charStart":23,"charEnd":25,"startMs":1940,"endMs":2020},{"word":"should","charStart":26,"charEnd":32,"startMs":2020,"endMs":2220},{"word":"include","charStart":33,"charEnd":40,"startMs":2220,"endMs":2480},{"word":"a","charStart":41,"charEnd":42,"startMs":2480,"endMs":2740},{"word":"map","charStart":43,"charEnd":46,"startMs":2740,"endMs":2820},{"word":"of","charStart":47,"charEnd":49,"startMs":2820,"endMs":2960},{"word":"the","charStart":50,"charEnd":53,"startMs":2960,"endMs":3160},{"word":"scho